+Show the Config
+----------------
+
+To inspect the application's configuration, use the :func:`config <cli.config_command>` command. This prints the configuration as JSON, with sensitive values masked. ::
+
+    $ flask config
+    {
+      "DEBUG": false,
+      "SECRET_KEY": "***",
+      "DATABASE_URL": "postgresql://localhost/mydb"
+    }
+
+Configuration keys containing ``SECRET``, ``PASSWORD``, ``TOKEN``, or ``KEY``
+are masked as ``"***"`` in the output.
+
+
